houette of a head filled with stars and galaxies, symbolizing introspection and the universe's mysteries.","target":"https://cdn.iai.tv/assets/Uploads/_resampled/FillWzUyMCwzNDBd/Consciousness-cosmology-and-the-collapse-of-common-sense.webp","line":155,"embedded":true},{"title":"consciousness is not fundamental","target":"https://cdn.iai.tv/assets/Uploads/_resampled/FillWzUyMCwzNDBd/consciousness-is-not-fundamental.webp","line":155,"embedded":true},{"title":"we need freud s forgotten concept to understand our political crisis","target":"https://cdn.iai.tv/assets/Uploads/_resampled/FillWzUyMCwzNDBd/we-need-freud-s-forgotten-concept-to-understand-our-political-crisis.webp","line":155,"embedded":true},{"title":"Article sign up image","target":"https://iai.tv/articles/themes/iaitv/images/signup-heading-img.svg","line":155,"embedded":true},{"title":"41 the future of the right","target":"https://cdn.iai.tv/assets/Uploads/_resampled/FillWzUyMCwzNDBd/41-the-future-of-the-right.webp","line":159,"embedded":true},{"title":"Reality Distortion2","target":"https://cdn.iai.tv/assets/Uploads/_resampled/FillWzUyMCwzNDBd/Reality-Distortion2.webp","line":159,"embedded":true},{"title":"we need freud s forgotten concept to understand our political crisis","target":"https://cdn.iai.tv/assets/Uploads/_resampled/FillWzUyMCwzNDBd/we-need-freud-s-forgotten-concept-to-understand-our-political-crisis.webp","line":159,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Existentialism and the videogame exposing our fear of freedom | Benjamin Carpenter","source":"https://iai.tv/articles/existentialism-and-the-video-game-exposing-humanitys-fear-of-freedoms-auid-3405?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=feed","author":["[[Benjamin Carpenter]]","[[iai Speakers & Authors]]"],"published":"2025-11-03","created":"2025-11-04","description":"Drawing on Sartre, Nietzsche, and Heidegger, philosopher Benjamin Carpenter shows how the hit game Persona 5 brings our flight from freedom to life.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines